{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_frncat_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_frncat_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"小点心","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_frncat_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"8657f4851214e973dfa269f78b5c9f6567666e703569db7e5bc2d6c026ba0834","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"慕斯精心布置，准备迎接前来罗德岛探望自己的妈妈，却从开始就出现了小小的意外......","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑纹“猫猫”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喵呜——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（等等哦，猫猫，今天也不能陪你们玩了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是我住的地方，妈咪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己一个人住吗，小点心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的，妈咪，我还有一位舍友，她也住在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"......是这样啊，妈咪都没有给她准备礼物，来之前没想到你是与别人合住一个房间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系的，妈咪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她有任务需要出外勤，短期内应该是没法回舰上了。她还说，如果你不介意的话，这几天可以睡在她的床上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，其实妈咪在接驳的城区里订了酒店......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也是，酒店里的陈设肯定比这里要好，妈咪住在那里肯定更舒服些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"不过嘛，酒店的房间虽然好，但没有我的小点心陪在身边，感觉那里有些空荡荡，一个人睡肯定会失眠的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，妈咪决定这几天都留在这里吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"（刮了下慕斯的鼻子）没错，小点心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道你要来，我昨天花了一整天做扫除，里面所有家具都被我擦得闪闪亮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"小点心，你记得吗？在家里，你连床都不用自己铺的啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛......和家里不一样的，很多事情都需要我自己动手，刚开始的确很不习惯，不过后来，我在适应的过程中学到了很多东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前都不知道，那么大一床被子，要怎么才能把它塞进被罩里面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一次尝试的时候，我费了半天劲都不得要领。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后，我满头大汗，终于把拉链拉上了，妈咪你猜怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差点把我自己给套进去了，哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"（尴尬的笑容）妈咪真的是很意外呢......哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈咪，把眼睛闭上好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，妈咪你先把眼睛闭上，就一小会儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......好好好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我保证，你看到我的房间一定会大吃一惊的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"......小点心，妈咪确实是大吃一惊啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呜，妈咪，不是的不是的，我早上离开时还不是这个样子的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一片狼藉的房间里，数只“猫猫”在里面窜跑打闹。\n挂在窗台上的那些一缕一缕的织物，依稀还能看出窗帘的原样。\n而原本放置在桌面上的那几只花瓶就没有那么好运了，统统被“猫猫”们扫落，沦为一地碎片。\n一只“猫猫”在桌子上抬头俯身，打算跳上旁边的衣柜。\n慕斯抬头看去，有一只花瓶歪倒在衣柜顶部，从边缘处探出半拉来，摇摇欲坠，岌岌可危。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"条纹“猫猫”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（蹿上柜顶）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"条纹“猫猫”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喵嗷呜——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不要动我的花瓶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"条纹“猫猫”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喵？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......坏猫猫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这些坏猫猫！真是太过分了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"没事没事，小点心，这些小淘气总是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈咪，对不起，房间里的这幅景象绝对不是我想要你看到的样子，我真的有好好收拾一遍的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"妈咪知道的，小点心，我们先找个地方坐下，一起想想办法，看怎么把房间恢复成原来的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"让我看看......这里还有没有能坐的地方？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈咪，小心地上的毛线绳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"小点心，什么？！啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈咪，你还好吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"......没事，小点心......别担心。就是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这就去叫医疗部的干员来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"不不......我没有受伤，是我刚刚摔倒的时候踩到了裙子。所以我想，不出意外的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"它的后面应该破了一个大洞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......忙活了一天好累啊，腰酸背痛，好难受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是慕斯你今天不是休假吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我妈咪要来了，我一直在为此做准备。这几天一直紧张得要死......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亲人来探望不是应该高兴才对吗？慕斯你为什么会紧张成这个样子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......一直很担心自己会让妈咪失望，比起优秀的兄弟姐妹，我是家里最平凡的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不仅事业上没有什么成就，还感染了见不得人的病症......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慕斯你不要这样妄自菲薄，前几天博士不是还特地在战斗后夸奖你进步飞速吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......可是，这些都远远不够，我的兄弟姐妹实在是太厉害啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布伦年纪轻轻就成了军队的中校，艾米丽刚毕业，就在好几家银行做顾问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦尔莱著作等身，是源石技艺研究领域的学术权威，还有我最小的弟弟卡尔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，瓦尔莱小姐？是我想的那个瓦尔莱小姐吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，没有错，她是我的亲姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我现在可算明白你为什么会紧张了，慕斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小时候，只要出席聚会，免不了要被别人和他们做一番比较。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然妈咪一直在人前维护我，但她那么要强的一个人，一定觉得有我这样的孩子很丢人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上流社会的家族这点最讨厌了，比这比那，到处都是闲言碎语。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以这次妈咪来，我得多多向她展示我在这里的成长啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好......瑟丽斯夫人，我是柏喙，是慕斯的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你好，柏喙小姐，辛苦你帮我补裙子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"真的非常感激，真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事没事，能帮上忙我很开心，哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙&瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看起来，慕斯的妈妈不是个健谈的人呢......慕斯怎么还不回来，我总不能就这么一直和她妈妈面对面干坐着吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（可该聊什么呢？算了，随便找点话题吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（深吸一口气）瑟丽斯夫人，我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈咪，我拿来了杏仁蛋糕，是你最喜欢的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（太好了，你终于回来了，慕斯！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柏喙，我也为你做了一份布丁挞，我记得你最爱吃这道甜点了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，慕斯！对了，瑟丽斯夫人的裙子我已经补好了，上身完全没有问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，柏喙小姐真的很厉害呢，那么大一个破洞经她的手修补过后，一点都看不出来呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，柏喙！以后你要是有什么想吃的甜点就告诉我，我、我一定给你做出来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太夸张了，慕斯。别傻站着了，一起坐下来品尝吧。我看瑟丽斯夫人也等不及要吃了，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"来吧，小点心，妈妈好久都没吃你做的蛋糕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈咪，柏喙，怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的是太美味了，慕斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，无论是蛋糕胚还是奶油都做得恰到好处，嗯......真的是非常非常......呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈咪，怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"......我好像吃到一些奇怪的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一撮毛？怎么会出现在蛋糕里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了，是猫猫的毛！妈咪，你不要吃了，我这就去给你换一份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，妈咪，是我当时没有关好厨房的门，才让猫猫跑了进来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......没有关系的，小点心，妈妈不介意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是妈咪你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"真的没有关系，小点心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（可是，妈咪你的眼圈都红了啊......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慕斯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，柏喙小姐，身为设计师，你一定对最近流行的款式颇为了解吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"因为庄园里的裁缝风格守旧，我不喜欢，所以一直想要订购几套新式的裙子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"所以问问你们年轻人，都喜欢些什么样式的裙子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......？哦哦，对，最近两年流行在裙子上加入针织元素。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"针织元素，我记得十几年前也流行过一阵子呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"avg_252_bibeak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以说，流行就是一个轮回......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沉默地扭着手指）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吽","speakerId":"avg_226_hmau_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慕斯小姐，菜都上齐了，你和你妈妈试试看，这口味能不能吃惯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（埋头喝茶）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"小点心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？啊，好、好多啊，吽先生，我刚才没有点这么多菜啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吽","speakerId":"avg_226_hmau_1","isRemote":false,"text":"岛上干员的亲属都是好不容易来一次，多送你两个菜，别客气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吽","speakerId":"avg_226_hmau_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我回去忙了，你们慢用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，谢谢你，吽先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，小点心，刚刚这位厨师先生也是你的朋友吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吽先生手很巧，会做很多炎国的糕点，我时不时会向他学一些技法，来丰富自己的经验。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"真是难得，以前你在庄园里，总是孤零零一个人，身边只有猫猫在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"我们又都有自己的事情要忙，唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当时，妈咪和爹地已经尽最大的努力保护我了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然来到这里后，我交到了很多朋友，但其实心里也一直在想念妈咪和爹地。当时收到你要来这里的消息，我真的非常激动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这里工作我没能赚很多钱，不过这两年还是攒了些积蓄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"小点心，这是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在可颂小姐那里买了一套茶杯，肯定是比不上妈咪在家里用的，希望妈咪你不要嫌弃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"（捂住胸口）怎么会呢，小点心？你送给我的，我怎么会不喜欢呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"看看这精致的托盘，真是太漂亮了，我带回去一定都舍不得用，说不定还要摆在柜子里，让每个人都能看见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈咪你喜欢就好，之前本来都是想向你好好表现的，可却在一直出糗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"你还在想之前的事吗，小点心？妈咪都告诉你了，没有事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我刚刚都看到......嗯，食堂怎么进来一只猫猫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，猫猫在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就、就在妈咪的背后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑纹“猫猫”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喵嗷——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！不要往桌子上跳啊，猫猫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了，我的杯子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇——！坏猫猫，你们这些坏猫猫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我讨厌你们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈咪好不容易来一次，为什么你们总是要过来捣乱！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我花了好久打扫屋子，攒了好久的钱给妈咪买礼物......呜呜......你们这些坏猫猫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"小点心，别哭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"（站起身）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吽","speakerId":"avg_226_hmau_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慕斯小姐，怎么了？我在厨房里听到你在哭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"avg_388_mint_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慕斯你不要捡地上的碎片了，可能会扎到你，我去拿扫把清理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的没事的，慕斯，杯子打碎不要紧，如果你需要，我那里有很多，你可以随便选一套。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵呜，怎么了怎么了？是谁欺负小慕斯了吗？别担心，我会和帽子一起把他狠狠修理一遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的......其实都要怪我自己没有做好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"众人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"瞎说什么！不许你这么说自己！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"（真的是太好了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"再靠过来些，小点心，我帮你把头发擦干。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"你把头发剪短了，妈咪记得你以前非常爱惜自己的长发呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出任务不方便，做蛋糕也不方便，所以我一狠心就都剪掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"......也好，你短头发看起来也好看，妈咪也喜欢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，躺上来睡觉吧，小点心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈咪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚你真的要和我挤一张床吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"你不想吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，只是担心你会睡不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上次瓦尔莱写信告诉我，你去看她的时候，一整夜都没睡踏实......你在她那里睡的还是五星级酒店。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和我挤在一起，你真的可以睡好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......不是的，妈咪那天不是因为床不好才失眠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦尔莱那时实验出了些事故，额头上留了好大一块疤，我一看到担心得要死，当然睡不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，幸好没什么大事，第二天，她准时出现在了台上作报告，非常精彩的报告，台下的掌声好久才停。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在台下一定很自豪吧，妈咪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"当然了，瓦尔莱从小就是个优秀的孩子，没怎么让我操过心。不像卡尔那个混小子，上个月胳膊摔断了还整天笑嘻嘻地跑来跑去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡尔比赛的时候受伤了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，都那样了还不愿意下场换人，硬是要坚持踢完整场比赛，你爹地知道后狠狠地把他臭骂了一顿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后，是他的球队赢了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"当然......他和他的队友是那个年龄段里最好的一批选手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈——好困......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（往被子里缩了缩）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈咪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......今天对我失望了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦尔莱和卡尔都是可以让妈咪自豪的孩子，可我不是......从小，我就没什么天赋，也没什么特长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在学校，我学习成绩也不起眼，染病后，让妈咪一直为我操心，甚至很长一段时间里，妈咪不得不抛下自己的工作，陪在我身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，妈咪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一直都不能让你为我骄傲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（转头）妈咪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Zzz......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小点心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（摸向床铺另一边）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"小点心？！奇怪，她去哪里了？天都还没亮呢......盥洗室里也没人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"条纹“猫猫”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咪呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"猫猫......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"小家伙，你知道我的小点心在哪里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"条纹“猫猫”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（低下头舔屁股）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"不要不理会我啊，猫猫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"条纹“猫猫”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（继续舔屁股）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，慕斯这一周以来一定忙着准备迎接我的事宜，冷落了你们这些小淘气，所以你们才会为了吸引她的注意调皮捣蛋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"我代她向你们说声抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"条纹“猫猫”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喵......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"（摸摸“猫猫”的下巴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"还在生气吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"条纹“猫猫”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喵呜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"你现在愿意带我去找她吗？"},{"type":"narration","text":"“猫猫”在瑟丽斯夫人的脚边轻轻蹭了蹭，然后蹲在门口，示意她跟上自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，已经六点了吗？不行，还得再快点，得赶在早饭前把面包烤好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天怎么就睡过了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许是因为睡在妈咪身边觉得很安心吧......面团已经准备好，可以制作内馅了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拿起盆子开始打发奶油）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......啊，手怎么在这个时候发痒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好难受，好想挠一挠......不行，一挠就没完没了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"让我来吧，小点心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈咪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你怎么来了，是我起床的时候吵到你了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"小点心，你每天都会起这么早，为这里的干员准备早餐吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......这是我唯一擅长的事情，何况，我也很喜欢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在庄园里，我没什么机会做这些，来到这里后，发现能够有所施展，感觉心里很开心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，我的小点心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"你做到哪一步了，我来和你一起弄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了，妈咪，我一个人能搞定的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看，面团已经发酵好了，内馅就交给我吧，奶油酱可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可、可以。不过妈咪你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘，小点心，这是独属于我们母女的时刻，我们可有很长时间都没有在一起做过面包了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，妈咪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"内馅就拜托你了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"厨房里，母女两人的身影不断在料理台和烤箱间穿行。\n她们之间几乎没有对话，一个轻微的眨眼，一个细微的动作，就已经足够完成所有的交流。\n羽兽蛋液被打进碗中，淡奶油渐渐充满气泡，发酵的面团被抹上糖浆，预热好的烤炉冒出丝丝烟气。\n丁零当啷，就是厨房里的颂歌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈咪，我们成功了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，小点心，我们成功了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赶在早饭前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，赶在早饭前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许可以再多做一些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（在面包上撒上一层糖霜）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这才是完美的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"我同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人&慕斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（对视良久）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"我为你自豪，小点心，非常非常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"我从来没和你说过，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么呢？妈咪如果自豪，应该是为了布伦、为了艾米丽、为了瓦尔莱、为了卡尔，他们都是优秀的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我......我只是不起眼的慕斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有两条尾巴，学不懂数学，文法一团糟，还得了矿石病，发病时......手还会变得很难看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"可这些妈咪从来都不在乎啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那妈咪到底在乎我什么呢？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"听着，小点心，妈咪只在乎你是不是快乐，是不是做着自己热爱的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"当时，关于要不要把你送到这里来，妈咪和爹地吵了很多次架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"妈咪不想让你一个人来到这里，生活条件比不上家里不说，如果你出了什么事，我们中没有一个人可以及时赶到你身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"来之前，我很忐忑，我想，如果我的小点心在这里过得不好，就是和你爹地狠狠打一架我也要带你回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"可你在这里非常幸福......不再孤零零一个人，有了那么多关心你的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我还是没有能够像瓦尔莱他们一样好好招待你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"并没有，小点心，我很满意啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，昨天从蛋糕里吃出猫猫的毛时，你都委屈得要落泪了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的，小点心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"我是在高兴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高兴......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"我很久都没吃到你做的蛋糕了，自从生病后，你就再也没有进过厨房了......小点心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚走进厨房时，妈咪还有了更令人惊喜的发现，你不仅重拾了自己的烘焙爱好，你还......还在这里继续着自己热爱的烘焙事业。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈咪的这些想法......我从来都不知道......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"慕斯，妈咪的小点心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"着急的小干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"慕斯姐姐，我今天有早课，麻烦你帮我装两个......呃，阿姨你好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你好，小朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是蔡斯啊，两个是吗......？装好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"着急的小干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢慕斯姐姐......咦，这个面包以前没有吃过，慕斯姐姐，这是什么种类啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯","speakerId":"avg_185_frncat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是随便做的，没有什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"它是“妈妈的骄傲”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慕斯&着急的小干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟丽斯夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"我说，这款面包的名字是“妈妈的骄傲”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","aliases":["杰西卡"]}]}
